    "_X5_note": "Core operations is where the module earns its existence. SETUP defines capability. Constructors create capacity. Core operations exercise both. If core operations is thin, the module's purpose is questionable. If it's bloated, the module is doing too much.",
    "_X5_scripture": "Ecclesiastes 9:10 — Whatsoever thy hand findeth to do, do it with thy might; for there is no work, nor device, nor knowledge, nor wisdom, in the grave, whither thou goest."
